{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24413","headline":"送蕲春李十九使君赴郡 · 白居易","name":"送蕲春李十九使君赴郡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜官职好文词，五十专城未是迟。\n晓日镜前无白发，春风门外有红旗。\n郡中何处堪携酒，席上谁人解和诗。\n唯共交亲开口笑，知君不及洛阳时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}